# Auditor portal documents never belong in the image. The 2026 audit set was ~649 MB of
# PDFs baked into every build. If the portal is reused, it must read from Spaces rather
# than the image — see docs/SYSTEM_OVERVIEW.md. Do not remove this rule to "fix" an empty
# portal; that reintroduces the bloat.
/Auditor Files/

